# OnboardingQueue™ (Platform Build Spec #010)

**No onboarding logic outside the queue.** All modal sequencing routes through `OnboardingQueueEngine`.

## Rules

- Wire dashboard via `OnboardingQueueProvider` inside `GenesisProvider`
- Register new steps via `Queue.add()` in `modules/` — never hardcode order in UI
- Mandatory order is fixed in `MANDATORY_ONBOARDING_ORDER` — conditional steps skip when ineligible
- Only **one popup at a time** — provider renders `nextModule` only
- Resume interrupted onboarding from `onboarding_queue_state.current_step_id`
- SquarePass services (MysterySquarePass, Founder, Flash) are reward **backends** — queue decides WHEN

## API

Player routes: authenticated session via `getSquarePassAuthorizedEmail()`.  
Admin routes: `getAuthorizedAdminUser()`.

Full spec: `docs/project-legacy/ONBOARDING_QUEUE.md`
